    "RS-03-trait-default-open": "The former trait-default-caller guard is subsumed by requiring direct module-level impl syntax. This mutant now removes the global default-name refusal required to close missing inherited candidates; the independent same-impl witness avoids masking by cross-trait or applicability guards.",
